00:05:08,181 --> 00:05:14,181
Fight to survive.

2
00:10:16,363 --> 00:10:22,363
Prisoner of War is a action, war, thriller film directed by Louis Mandylor.

3
00:15:24,545 --> 00:15:30,545
British RAF Wing Commander James Wright is captured by the Japanese during
WWII and forced to fight in brutal hand-to-hand combat.

4
00:20:32,727 --> 00:20:38,727
The Japanese soldiers get more than they bargained for when Wright’s years of
martial arts training in Hong Kong prove him to be a formidable opponent.

5
00:25:40,909 --> 00:25:46,909
Wing Commander James Wright, played by Scott Adkins.

6
00:30:49,090 --> 00:30:55,090
Lt. Col. Benjiro Ito, played by Peter Shinkoda.

7
